# The `origin` remote (github.com/najathakram/najathakram.info) is PUBLIC. This
# repository holds the website and nothing else.
#
# Personal documents have been MOVED OUT of the repo entirely, to
# C:\ClaudeCode\private\ (Visa and Resume). They were verified on 2026-08-11 as
# never having been committed on any branch, and no PDF or DOCX has ever existed
# in this repository's history. These patterns stay as a backstop in case the
# folders are ever recreated here by accident:
#   Visa    scanned passports and visa application forms for named family
#           members. Publishing those would expose other people's identity
#           documents.
#   Resume  resume sources and PROJECTS.md, which detail internal employer work.
#           The two resume PDFs that ARE meant to be public live in
#           public/resume/ and are committed.
/Visa/
/Resume/

